WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.279
Please welcome Ben Schwartz.

2
00:00:02.279 --> 00:00:03.112
(audience applauds)

3
00:00:03.112 --> 00:00:04.599
Hi, Ben

4
00:00:04.599 --> 00:00:06.668
Oh my god, Drew, we're wearing the same flower.

5
00:00:06.668 --> 00:00:07.675
This is insane.

6
00:00:07.675 --> 00:00:09.927
(Drew and Ross laughing)

7
00:00:09.927 --> 00:00:11.553
