141
00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:03.391
Ross and I are absolute dogs.

142
00:04:03.391 --> 00:04:04.851
(Drew and Ross laughing)

143
00:04:04.851 --> 00:04:06.040
Absolute dogs.

144
00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.050
Just maniacs,

145
00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:10.170
rabid dogs eating there (mimmicks).

146
00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:11.991
I told you it's for bad boys.

147
00:04:11.991 --> 00:04:13.750
(Drew and Ben laughing)

148
00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:14.583
What are you?

149
00:04:14.583 --> 00:04:15.416
Are you creamy or crunchy?

150
00:04:15.416 --> 00:04:16.950
I'm both.

151
00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:18.191
I'm a straddler.

152
00:04:18.191 --> 00:04:19.700
(laughs)

153
00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:21.990
I'm naughty and nice

154
00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:23.540
As you've gotten old,

155
00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.653
