156
00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:30.220
Oh, one side definitely takes over more sometimes.

157
00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:31.736
I get real crunchy sometimes.

158
00:04:31.736 --> 00:04:34.190
(laughs)

159
00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:36.647
But then I also get really creamy sometimes.

160
00:04:36.647 --> 00:04:37.970
(Ross laughs)

161
00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:39.830
I can be like super packed with peanuts

162
00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:42.545
